# src/tmux TODO

- Record and commit the tmux 3.7b fixtures on the Mac
  (`cargo run --example record-tmux-fixtures -- --out tests/fixtures/tmux/3.7b`) and
  replay them in `tests/tmux_session.rs`. daemon-core.md §8 requires both 3.4 and 3.7b;
  only 3.4 exists.
- Run the real-tmux suites with no locale set (LANG/LC_ALL unset) in CI, as
  daemon-core.md §8 requires, to catch a missing `-u` turning non-ASCII names into `_`.
- tmux 3.8 (Homebrew's current) rejects a tab in a window name and names a new
  session's window `tmux` instead of `sh`; two `tests/tmux_real.rs` cases fail there.
  Supported versions are 3.4 and 3.7b; decide whether 3.8 joins them.
